      <LocalizedText>
        <Text id="LOC_MOD_GOVERNMENT_NAME">
          <en_US>[COLOR:Civ6Yellow]More Government[ENDCOLOR]</en_US>
          <zh_Hans_CN>[COLOR:Civ6Yellow]更丰富的政体[ENDCOLOR]</zh_Hans_CN>
        </Text>
        <Text id="LOC_MOD_GOVERNMENT_DESC">
          <en_US>In game settings, players may activate the Celebration Mode, which grants brand new experience with regards to [ICON_Amenities] Amenities and [ICON_CelebrationHappiness] Happiness. This game mode is inspired by Celebrations and other mechanisms of Sid Meier's Civilization VII.</en_US>
          <zh_Hans_CN>不再被原版政体节奏束缚，8 种政体覆盖扩张、经济、军事、科技等全维度需求，让你的每一局文明征程，都有全新战略方向！现在加载 MOD，开启属于你的专属政体时代！</zh_Hans_CN>
        </Text>
        <Text id="LOC_MOD_GOVERNMENT_AUTHORS">
          <en_US>Nwflower,xXiKillYouXX</en_US>
          <zh_Hans_CN>千川白浪，xXiKillYouXX</zh_Hans_CN>
        </Text>
      </LocalizedText>
    <FrontEndActions>
